13.1287C25.3686 13.1287 24.4578 12.4186 24.1452 11.0106H22.368C22.5809 13.2715 24.2597 14.6081 26.7052 14.6081C28.7385 14.6081 30.8 13.5423 30.8 11.4659C30.8 9.38964 29.0794 8.7361 27.2739 8.38041L26.0086 8.13918C25.1274 7.96933 24.4726 7.57056 24.4726 6.77425C24.4726 5.76502 25.6529 5.40933 26.4492 5.40933C27.4585 5.40933 28.5391 5.76502 28.8382 7.00194H30.5871C30.1748 4.85425 28.5822 3.92994 26.5489 3.92994C24.6572 3.92994 22.6523 4.89733 22.6523 6.83087C22.6523 8.57979 24.0037 9.41794 25.6246 9.74533Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a><p class="h5 margin-b-sml">Based on GADIGAL country SYDNEY NSW Australia</p></div><p class="h5">Springboards copyright 2026</p></div></div></footer><script src="https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=671066341ba9e0aa38293604" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671066341ba9e0aa38293604/js/webflow.schunk.36b8fb49256177c8.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-4abIlA5/v7XaW1HMXKBgnUuhnjBYJ/Z9C1OSg4OhmVw9O3QeHJ/qJqFBERCDPv7G" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671066341ba9e0aa38293604/js/webflow.schunk.0c46d98c4a13bcb7.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-C3JXH9o78tncn2vrFfpoq/0DptB9+Q+nIvB+3s49XAaC+fjXQYFcOJ3tjA6URz7m" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/671066341ba9e0aa38293604/js/webflow.7ebe621d.b41f74ea68bd3efd.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-VPegARRCguk8zYAaMWL2cuwIIJ4k/PHzR7JUmKtjljzFneVuAMgm4/f7MHNvsFyK" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->
